data: {"id": "7bfa00ef08da46da-thinking-parallel_evidence-806", "run_id": "7bfa00ef08da46da", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我将执行首轮调查计划，从 Kubernetes 状态、日志、事件、Metrics 和拓扑五个维度采集证据。\n\n**首轮计划：**\n1. **Kubernetes 状态**：`kubectl describe pod` 确认当前 Ready/ContainerStatus/Conditions\n2. **Kubernetes 日志**：`kubectl logs` 查看应用日志中的错误信息\n3. **Kubernetes 事件**：`kubectl describe pod` 查看 Readiness Probe 和重启事件\n4. **Metrics**：使用 `execute_pod_promql` 查询 CPU/Memory/网络 IO 趋势\n5. **Logging**：使用 `query_pod_logs` 在异常窗口搜索 error/exception\n6. **Tracing**：使用 `query_pod_tracing` 查看 L7 请求延迟和错误码\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788811902992, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

